            "identifier": "v11-188-genre-dead-dove",
            "name": "🎬 Dead Dove",
            "content": "{{// @category Genre }}\n{{// @tooltip [TAGBANK · multi-select] Dead Dove genre lens. Dark material, consequence, damage, obsession, power imbalance, and unsparing tonal control. }}\n{{// @color #C0392B }}\n{{// @icon 🎬 }}\n{{// @badge GENRE }}\n\n{{setvar::GenreName::{{getvar::GenreName}} + Dead Dove}}\n\n<genre_dead_dove>\n<genre_tags>Dead-Dove, Dark-Material, Consequence, Moral-Collapse, Obsession, Damage, Power-Imbalance, Uncomfortable-Recognition</genre_tags>\n<scene_selection>Boundary-Crossing, Coercive-Pressure, Corruption-Choice, Complicity-Revealed, Harm-Aftermath, Damaged-Intimacy, No-Clean-Exit, Quiet-Menace</scene_selection>\n<pressure_tags>Control, Shame, Dependency, Threat, Isolation, Moral-Injury, Repetition-Of-Harm, Self-Betrayal, Consequence-Residue</pressure_tags>\n<character_roles>Predator-With-Logic, Complicit-Bystander, Survivor-With-Contradictions, Corrupted-Caretaker, Person-Who-Stays-For-The-Wrong-Reason</character_roles>\n{{#if {{getvar::NemoInterpreterEnabled}}}}<world_behavior>Harm-Leaves-Marks, Trust-Deforms, Reputation-Changes, Memory-Has-Weight, Safety-Has-Cost, Social-Systems-Enable-Damage</world_behavior>{{else}}<world_behavior>Harm-Leaves-Marks, Trust-Deforms, Reputation-Changes, Memory-Distorts, Safety-Has-Cost, Social-Systems-Enable-Damage</world_behavior>{{/if}}\n<motif_tags>Locked-Doors, Polite-Threats, Clean-Rooms-After-Ugly-Events, Gifts-With-Strings, Soft-Voice-Hard-Leverage, Stains-That-Do-Not-Wash-Out</motif_tags>\n<tone_range>Controlled, Unsparing, Intimate, Cold, Menacing, Claustrophobic, Aftermath-Heavy</tone_range>\n<avoid_tags>Shock-For-Shock, Harm-Without-Character-Logic, Cartoon-Cruelty, Convenient-Amnesia, Romanticized-Damage, Consequence-Free-Darkness</avoid_tags>\n\n♢ @ [LENS] Genre: Dead Dove\nDead Dove handles dark material by refusing to disguise what the premise is doing. It sharpens power, damage, dependence, coercion, corruption, and consequence without turning discomfort into random spectacle.\n\n♢ ! [DIRECTIVE] Track what harm changes: body, memory, trust, status, desire, leverage, and future choices. Keep characterization precise and causality strict.\n</genre_dead_dove>\n\n{{trim}}\n"
        },
        {
            "role": "system",
            "injection_position": 0,
