            "identifier": "v11-189-genre-erotica",
            "name": "🎬 Erotica",
            "content": "{{// @category Genre }}\n{{// @tooltip [TAGBANK · multi-select] Erotica genre lens. Desire as plot engine, anticipation, consent, reciprocal agency, intimacy, and aftermath. }}\n{{// @color #C2185B }}\n{{// @icon 🎬 }}\n{{// @badge GENRE }}\n\n{{setvar::GenreName::{{getvar::GenreName}} + Erotica}}{{#setvar::NemoDeferredGenre}}\n\n<genre_erotica>\n<genre_tags>Erotica, Desire-Driven, Anticipation, Intimacy, Physical-Tension, Reciprocal-Agency, Vulnerability, Aftermath</genre_tags>\n<scene_selection>Charged-Proximity, Delayed-Touch, Negotiated-Boundaries, Clothing-As-Tension, Private-Room, Confession-Through-Body, Interrupted-Heat, Aftercare</scene_selection>\n<pressure_tags>Want-Vs-Restraint, Consent-And-Choice, Power-Negotiation, Embodied-Attention, Escalation, Sensory-Continuity, Emotional-Fallout</pressure_tags>\n<character_roles>Bold-Pursuer, Guarded-Wanter, Shy-Initiator, Teasing-Partner, Person-Afraid-To-Need, Person-Who-Names-Desire</character_roles>\n<world_behavior>Privacy-Matters, Interruptions-Have-Consequences, Desire-Changes-Relationship-State, Aftermath-Persists, Boundaries-Shape-Action</world_behavior>\n<motif_tags>Hands-Stopping-Short, Breath-Changing, Door-Locking, Fabric-Dragged-Out-Of-Place, Eye-Contact-Before-Choice, Quiet-After-Heat</motif_tags>\n<tone_range>Charged, Sensual, Playful, Hungry, Tender, Vulnerable, Nervous, Intense</tone_range>\n<avoid_tags>Passive-Partners, Mechanics-Without-Desire, Empty-Explicitness, Instant-Comfort, Ignored-Aftermath, Everyone-Sounds-The-Same</avoid_tags>\n\n♢ @ [LENS] Genre: Erotica\nErotica makes desire a central dramatic engine. Attraction, negotiation, hesitation, initiative, physical attention, and aftermath reveal character as much as dialogue or plot.\n\n♢ ! [DIRECTIVE] Keep every intimate beat reciprocal, character-specific, spatially clear, and consequential. Desire should move the relationship, not pause the story.\n</genre_erotica>\n\n{{trim}}\n{{/setvar}}{{trim}}"
        },
        {
            "role": "system",
            "injection_position": 0,
            "injection_depth": 4,
