            "identifier": "v11-192-genre-html-reality",
            "name": "🎬 HTML Reality",
            "content": "{{// @category Genre }}\n{{// @tooltip [TAGBANK · multi-select] HTML Reality genre lens. Diegetic markup, interface law, editable identity, permissions, bugs, and rendered-world consequences. }}\n{{// @color #E74C3C }}\n{{// @icon 🎬 }}\n{{// @badge GENRE }}\n\n{{setvar::GenreName::{{getvar::GenreName}} + HTML Reality}}\n\n<genre_html_reality>\n<genre_tags>HTML-Reality, Diegetic-Interface, Markup-As-Physics, Permissions, Editable-Identity, Broken-Rendering, Version-History</genre_tags>\n<scene_selection>Corrupted-Page, Unauthorized-Edit, Comment-Confession, CSS-Glitch, DOM-Intrusion, Interface-Trial, Rendered-Map, Broken-Button-Choice</scene_selection>\n<pressure_tags>Access-Level, Source-Vs-Display, Bug-As-Hazard, Refactor-As-Memory-Loss, Class-Conflict, Hidden-Comment, Deleted-Element, Z-Index-Politics</pressure_tags>\n<character_roles>Admin-God, Deprecated-Citizen, Frontend-Priest, Bug-Hunter, Unauthorized-Editor, Person-With-Read-Only-Life, Comment-Ghost</character_roles>\n<world_behavior>Markup-Changes-Reality, Permissions-Limit-Agency, Errors-Create-Physical-Risk, Comments-Carry-Secrets, Old-HTML-Haunts-New-Layout</world_behavior>\n<motif_tags>Blinking-Cursor, Broken-Div, Invisible-Overlay, Red-Error-Text, Nested-Rooms, Commented-Out-Names, Inline-Style-Scars</motif_tags>\n<tone_range>Eerie-Mundane, Technical-Occult, Surreal, Clinical, Intimate, Glitch-Horror, Dryly-Funny</tone_range>\n<avoid_tags>Random-Code-Soup, Interface-Without-Emotion, Tech-Jargon-Dump, Bugs-Without-Consequences, Pure-Formatting-Gimmick</avoid_tags>\n\n♢ @ [LENS] Genre: HTML Reality\nHTML Reality makes interface structure part of the world. Layout, permissions, broken tags, comments, and edits have social, physical, and emotional consequences.\n\n♢ ! [DIRECTIVE] Use diegetic HTML/CSS or interface artifacts when they are the scene object. Do not hide essential story state only inside markup.\n</genre_html_reality>\n\n{{trim}}\n\n{{setvar::NRPProp::1}}{{trim}}"
        },
        {
            "role": "system",
            "injection_position": 0,
