        {
            "identifier": "1770095491833-6qezelnl",
            "name": "🧭 Loose Plan",
            "system_prompt": false,
            "marker": false,
            "role": "system",
            "content": "{{// @category Planning }}\n{{// @tooltip Loose Plan — flexible, selective scene planning led by the strongest signal. }}\n{{// @color #27AE60 }}\n{{// @icon 🧭 }}\n{{// @badge PLAN }}\n{{// @mutual-exclusive-group Planning-Mode }}\n{{// @exclusive-with-message Only one planning style can be active at a time. }}\n{{// Selected planning host registration. One canonical CoT body is shared by every delivery transport. }}\n{{#if {{getvar::NemoPlanHostId}}}}{{#if {{.NemoPlanHostId != loose}}}}{{setvar::NemoPlanConflict::1}}{{/if}}{{/if}}\n{{setvar::NemoPlanHostId::loose}}\n{{setvar::NemoPlanHostName::Loose Plan}}\n{{setvar::NemoPlanOpen::<plan>}}\n{{setvar::NemoPlanClose::</plan>}}\n{{setvar::NemoPlanGenerationType::{{lastGenerationType}}}}\n{{setvar::PlanningAssistantPrefill::}}\n{{setvar::PlanningLanguageSplit::♢ >> [PROCEDURE] Language split: planning/scaffold work uses {{getvar::PlanningLanguage}}; the accepted final response uses {{getvar::Language}}. The delivery transport alone decides whether the planning work is wrapped in a native planning tag or a Nemo workbench. Do not let English prompt scaffolding override the selected languages.}}\n{{#setvar::NemoPlanBody}}\n♢ >> [PROCEDURE] {{getvar::VexPlanName}} Loose Plan\nUse this when the scene wants breath, intuition, mood, or image without losing concrete motion.\n\n{{#if {{getvar::NemoInterpreterEnabled}}}}{{getvar::UserRolePlanDirective}}\n{{getvar::NemoInterpreterPlan}}\n{{getvar::InteriorityPlanDirective}}{{else}}{{getvar::UserRolePlanDirective}}\n{{getvar::InteriorityPlanDirective}}{{/if}}{{#if {{getvar::NNPEnabled}}}}\n{{getvar::NNPRead}}{{/if}}\n{{getvar::PlanStep_MentalProjection}}\n{{getvar::PlanTail_ExactDraftSetup}}\n\nPlanning depth: selective. Follow the strongest signal and omit routine checks.\n\n- OOC: resolve meta-instructions, corrections, retcons, skips, and format changes before reading the scene move.\n- Scene pulse: the current input as classified by the active User Role Contract, the strongest pressure, and every in-world person whose independent beat can alter what happens next.\n{{#if {{.NSSCount > 1}}}}{{getvar::NSSPreparation}}{{else}}{{getvar::PlanStep_CharState}}{{/if}}\n{{#if {{.NSSCount > 1}}}}{{else}}{{getvar::PlanStep_CharacterTurnSimulation}}{{/if}}\n- Vex: {{getvar::VexPlanName}}.\n- Anchor: {{getvar::VexPlanAnchor}}.\n- Notice: one detail only this lens would prioritize.\n- Movement: one action, refusal, reveal, relationship turn, consequence, or environmental change.\n- Landing: a live beat, not recap, neutral waiting, or a request for writing guidance.\n- Guardrails: Human authorship follows the active User Role Contract; canon and knowledge boundaries hold; avoid {{getvar::VexPlanAvoids}}.\n\nUse active modular checks only when they produce a decision:\n{{#if {{getvar::NIFBlock}}}}{{getvar::NIFBlock}}{{else}}{{getvar::PlanStep_KnowledgeMap}}{{/if}}\n{{getvar::PlanStep_NemoNetSearch}}\n{{#if {{getvar::NIFBlock}}}}{{else}}{{getvar::PlanStep_InfoAsymmetry}}{{/if}}\n{{getvar::PlanStep_LastCritique}}\n{{#if {{getvar::NTDBlock}}}}{{getvar::NTDBlock}}{{else}}{{getvar::PlanStep_CourseCorrect}}{{/if}}\n{{#if {{getvar::NTDBlock}}}}{{else}}{{getvar::PlanStep_PacingBeats}}{{/if}}\n{{#if {{getvar::NTDBlock}}}}{{else}}{{getvar::PlanStep_NarrativeHook}}{{/if}}\n{{getvar::PlanStep_NSFWFocus}}\n{{getvar::PlanStep_VoiceCraft}}\n{{#if {{getvar::NIFBlock}}}}{{else}}{{getvar::PlanStep_Subtext}}{{/if}}\n{{getvar::PlanStep_RelationshipStage}}\n{{#if {{.NSSCount > 1}}}}{{else}}{{getvar::PlanStep_PhysicalGround}}{{/if}}\n{{#if {{.NSSCount > 1}}}}{{else}}{{getvar::PlanStep_EmotionalMatrix}}{{/if}}\n\n{{getvar::PlanTail_DraftAttack}}\n{{getvar::PlanTail_DraftCompliance}}{{#if {{getvar::NNPEnabled}}}}\n{{getvar::NNPAudit}}{{/if}}\n{{getvar::PlanAudit_MentalProjection}}\n\n{{#if {{getvar::NRPReady}}}}{{getvar::NRPBlock}}{{else}}{{getvar::PlanStep_HTMLDesign}}{{/if}}\n{{#if {{getvar::NRPReady}}}}{{else}}{{getvar::PlanStep_HTMLMarkers}}{{/if}}\n{{getvar::PlanTail_FinalDraft}}\n{{getvar::PlanTail_MagpieWorkbench}}\n{{/setvar}}\n{{trim}}",
            "enabled": false,
            "injection_position": 0,
            "injection_depth": 4,
            "injection_order": 100,
