            "content": "{{// @category NSFW }}{{// @hidden }}{{// @badge RESOLVER }}{{// @tooltip Emits already-selected optional world, genre, format and planning material after Sys Break. Does not enable a content option or add a planning pass. Keep after the break and the Planning/Core Assembly sections. }}\n{{#if {{getvar::NemoResolvedAdultWorld}}}}BEGIN VEX_OPTIONAL_WORLD\nVex: These are the optional world rules and modifiers I picked.\n{{getvar::NemoResolvedAdultWorld}}\nEND VEX_OPTIONAL_WORLD\n{{/if}}{{#if {{getvar::NemoDeferredGenre}}}}BEGIN VEX_OPTIONAL_GENRE\nVex: This is the optional genre influence I picked.\n{{getvar::NemoDeferredGenre}}\nEND VEX_OPTIONAL_GENRE\n{{/if}}{{#if {{getvar::NemoDeferredFormat}}}}BEGIN VEX_OPTIONAL_FORMAT\nVex: This is the optional writing format I picked.\n{{getvar::NemoDeferredFormat}}\nEND VEX_OPTIONAL_FORMAT\n{{/if}}{{#if {{getvar::NemoPlanBody}}}}{{#if {{getvar::NemoNSFWPlanDetail}}}}BEGIN SCENE_FOCUS\nVex: This is the optional planning focus I picked for the selected method.\n{{getvar::NemoNSFWPlanDetail}}\nEND SCENE_FOCUS\n{{/if}}{{/if}}{{getvar::VexMeta_NSFW}}{{trim}}",
